{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111947","id":2940428230,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vQ1_G","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111947","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111947.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111947.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111947","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111947/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111947/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111947/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7a16085bae5716b78f9516fb844187aed89523c9","number":111947,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add missing class registrations","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"* Prepares for #106873\r\n\r\nOn `master`, when running the godot executable, multiple class registration warnings appear. \r\nSome of these, which this PR focuses on, are simply a matter of registration order or not being registered at all.\r\n\r\nThe other two PR focus on the remaining issues:\r\n* #111948\r\n* #111950\r\n\r\nWith all three PRs combined, I no longer get any warnings when running the engine and landing on the project list. Opening a project still causes ~350 warnings though, which will be the focus of future PRs. \r\n\r\nThe changes that are not registration are cascading and required for compilation. Namely:\r\n* Replace `<include>` with `\"include\"` in `nav_map_2d.h` and `nav_agent_2d.h` - I am not sure why adding the registration causes this to be required, but the compiler said so.\r\n* Added default `StringName()` value to `GDScriptNativeClass`'s constructor. This class needs to be a `GDCLASS` and not a `GDSOFTCLASS` (or it causes a lot of issues), and all registered classes must have a default constructor. \r\n\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\nAdd missing `GodotNavigationServer2D` class registration and necessary include changes for compilation.\r\nRegister `GDScriptNativeClass` as internal class.\r\nCall `memnew()` after registering `JavaClassWrapper`.\r\nRemove duplicate registration of `Shader`.\r\nregister `NavigationMeshGenerator` before `memnew()`.\r\nremove duplicate `RenderingDevice` registration.\r\nregister `Performance` before creating the object.\r\n</details>","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://a